 "operationalization": {
  "rules": [
   "base book: 1h bare CISD (series_open, 2/2 swings, max_wait=3), decide at the confirming 1h close, enter next M1 open, stop at the protected swing, 10h hold",
   "T1 = nearest confirmed unbroken 1h 2/2 swing high above entry (long) / low below entry (short), last 200 1h bars, at least 0.25x initial risk from entry",
   "T2 = prior completed NY trading day's high (long) / low (short) at the decision; keep only trades with T2 beyond T1",
   "scan M1 from entry within the 10h hold: first of stop / T1 (stop wins ties); keep trades that reach T1 first",
   "event (the runner) at the close of the T1 M1 bar: same direction, stop = original entry price (break even), target = T2, hold 10h; scored vs matched random entry",
   "the 20% partial at T1 is identical under any variant and is not scored"
  ],
